title Real-time analytics on GCP
direction right

Devices [icon: iot]
Web clients [icon: browser]

GCP project [icon: google-cloud, color: blue] {
  Ingest [color: blue] {
    Load balancer [icon: gcp-load-balancing]
    Collector [icon: gcp-cloud-run, description: Cloud Run]
    Events topic [icon: gcp-pubsub]
  }
  Processing [color: green] {
    Stream pipeline [icon: gcp-dataflow]
    Batch jobs [icon: gcp-dataproc]
    Scheduler [icon: gcp-cloud-scheduler]
  }
  Storage [color: purple] {
    Raw archive [icon: gcp-cloud-storage]
    Analytics warehouse [icon: gcp-bigquery]
    Feature store [icon: gcp-bigtable]
  }
  Serving [color: orange] {
    Dashboards [icon: dashboard, description: Looker Studio]
    Prediction API [icon: gcp-vertex-ai]
  }
  Monitoring [icon: gcp-cloud-monitoring]
}

Devices, Web clients > Load balancer > Collector > Events topic
Events topic > Stream pipeline
Stream pipeline > Analytics warehouse, Feature store
Stream pipeline --> Raw archive: replay copy
Scheduler > Batch jobs
Raw archive > Batch jobs > Analytics warehouse
Analytics warehouse > Dashboards
Feature store > Prediction API
Monitoring -- Ingest, Processing
